<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia buys 125,000 tonnes soft wheat -trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 125,000 tonnes soft wheat -trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia purchased five lots of 25,000 tonnes each of soft wheat for March-April shipment at $158.77 and $156.76 per tonne C&amp;F at a tender on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>Details-</p>
<p> - 01-10 March 1997    25,000 tonnes  at $158.77 per tonne C&amp;F</p>
<p> -10-20 March	    25,000 tonnes  at $158.77 per tonne C&amp;F</p>
<p> -20-31 March	    25,000 tonnes  at $158.77 per tonne C&amp;F</p>
<p> -01-10 April	    2 x 25,000 tonnes at $156.76 C&amp;F.</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
